 Now my question is how to include the single platform data in the analys=
is?
 I did a mcds analysis only for the single platform data and applied the
g(0) (which I gained from the mrds analysis) on the abundance estimate.=20=

How to combine the two estimates to get one abundance estimate with
confidence intervals for the entire survey?
Or could I include both single and double observer data in an mrds analys=
is
(e.g. add the single platform data to the primary data gained in double
platform modus)?=20

Thanks for your help,=20
Verena

